{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12082","headline":"病鹤篇 · 钱起","name":"病鹤篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独鹤声哀羽摧折，沙头一点留残雪。\n三山侣伴能远翔，五里裴回忍爲别。\n惊羣各畏野人机，谁肯相将霞水飞。\n不及川凫长比翼，随波双泛复双归。\n碧海沧江深且广，目尽天倪安得往。\n云山隔路不隔心，宛颈和鸣长在想。\n何时白雾卷青天，接影追飞太液前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}